Replaces: edge-proxy
Description: Layer 4 HTTP proxy for Pelion Edge
 Provides a proxy for Pelion Edge components that routes traffic
 through Edge Core.
 .
 This is the layer 4 variant used by stargate. It proxies to the
 stargate service address with the reverse tunnel disabled, and
 replaces the edge-proxy package. Install edge-proxy instead for KaaS.
